  <item>
    <title>站着赚钱和真心热爱同样重要｜当跳跳和超级猩猩用户对话，她在聊什么？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68259a6a5ccf03732bfe0764</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">68259a6a5ccf03732bfe0764</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 16 May 2025 13:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>这是一期串台节目，超级猩猩CEO、《猩球故事》主播之一跳跳来到超级猩猩用户Zoe的播客《Hold on, please》，一起聊聊女孩儿的「创业」和「自我实现」。</span></p><span></span><p><span>我就要这样打工到退休吗?</span></p><span></span><p><span>我就要这样生子进入家庭吗?</span></p><span></span><p><span>是不是还差点意思?</span></p><span></span><p><span>打工好像不足以实现自我，但创业又如同雾中看花，不是那么清晰……</span></p><span></span><p><span>带着这些疑问，处于30岁出头迷茫巅峰期的Zoe与已经走过30代的跳跳对话，希望能给有类似迷茫的听众们带来一些共鸣和启发。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="580">09:40</a> 跳跳的30岁，同样迷茫</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="880">14:40</a> 你需要找到一件做起来像玩儿一样容易的事<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1160">19:20</a>万事都没有那么功利，更多是内心的喜悦</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1730">28:50</a> 创业的安全感来自于:预先设定好下限</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3085">51:25</a> 保持独立性的优先级最高，当一个成年人太快乐了!</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4303">71:43</a> 创业就一定要拼尽全力劳体劳肤吗?可不可以站着把钱赚了?</span></p><span></span><p><span>💡</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期节目转载自</span></p><span></span><p><span>播客《Hold on, please》</span></p><span></span><p><span>小宇宙：hold on, please</span></p><span></span><p><span>网易云音乐：肉肉桃酱Zoe</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/67a481381659407fc8dc2a8a/ljcawgOm52heZ9kFtgFzQ9sg2E6f.m4a" length="76740586" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:19:05</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fo5h_VGN2C-swGE1nCzjfNYfhXOO.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>责任越大能力越大，解锁TJ Bai在超级猩猩的多重身份</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/681b1fd1db57cd35f7fbb9b8</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">681b1fd1db57cd35f7fbb9b8</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 08 May 2025 13:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>TJ Bai，大家都叫他小白，他在2017年加入超级猩猩，八年时间过去，如今他从一名团课教练转型为综训业务北京/成都城市负责人，一路以来他都有什么样的精彩故事？</span></p><span></span><p><span>当然，角色的转变同样也面临着更大的挑战，焦虑、自豪、认同感……自诩为健身行业里的“教育家”的小白是如何不断成长与蜕变？现阶段又有什么新目标呢？</span></p><span></span><p><span>一名团课教练在超级猩猩的无限可能性，就在本期《猩球故事》中——</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> 满员奖是团课教练的勋章</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="656">10:56</a> 加入综合训练业务的引路人和契机</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1111">18:31</a> 一窥私教们的闭门修炼</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1226">20:26</a> 成都VS.北京是健身行业的极与极</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1464">24:24</a> 成为综训业务负责人，焦虑与成就感并存</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1945">32:25</a> “健身行业的教育家”概括了我的职业生涯</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2439">40:39</a> 除了健身，无法想象别种人生</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2680">44:40</a> 超级猩猩私教在变化中升级</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2986">49:46</a> 影响更多人变得“很超级猩猩”</span></p><span></span><p><span>💡本期制作</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播：鲸鱼</span></p><span></span><p><span>嘉宾：TJ Bai</span></p><span></span><p><span>摄制：汤汤、阿肆</span></p><span></span><p><span>制作：鲸鱼</span></p><span></span><p><span>音乐：Nancy Leticia - Emergence、Ziv Moran - High Time、Tristan Barton - Ocean</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/67a481381659407fc8dc2a8a/lrGeJGY0H66e2V-aJssBlNTi_gS9.m4a" length="52892235" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:54:30</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fio9VZVwfCVgvv2lt_ThGEc4ijPe.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>从幼儿园园长到蹦床教练，听Molly解读快乐旷野人生</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/681b1f7adb57cd35f7fba4df</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">681b1f7adb57cd35f7fba4df</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 07 May 2025 08:58:07 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期《猩球故事》的嘉宾是成都超级猩猩的活力蹦床教练Molly。在成为团课教练之前，她是当时成都“最年轻的幼儿园园长”，她也曾经和我们一样，也是每天在超级猩猩花一个小时运动和释放自己的用户。</span></p><span></span><p><span>当Molly是一位蹦床用户时，超级猩猩是带她走出至暗时刻的一束光，而当她成为教练，她自己也成为一束光，照亮更多人。成为教练，是Molly精进自己的过程中顺其自然的结果，是重启人生的起点，她的目标是更好的自己。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> 从园长变教练是一个勇敢的过程</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="770">12:50</a> 活力蹦床是梦开始的地方</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1069">17:49</a> 做一个“有人味儿”的学习型教练</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1474">24:34</a> 超级猩猩带我走出至暗时刻</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1819">30:19</a> 做教练比做用户更快乐！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2002">33:22</a> 闪闪发光的是走过的每一段经历</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2277">37:57</a> 让梦想发生，就很超级猩猩</span></p><span></span><p><span>💡本期制作</span></p><span></span><p><span>嘉宾：Molly</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播&amp;制作：鲸鱼</span></p><span></span><p><span>摄制：阿肆</span></p><span></span><p><span>音乐：Shinto - This Will Work Out，Shinto - Sun Love - No Whistle，Assaf Ayalon - All That Matters</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/67a481381659407fc8dc2a8a/lnlnx_Ko0dxUrAAoS2PhIpo0Jg_C.m4a" length="42188745" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:43:28</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvhKQPrkDUZNqVndmhHlF0C2uERR.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>辣妈教练Angela重返超级猩猩，不完美也是一种完美</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/680f49458aed253fa301a959</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">680f49458aed253fa301a959</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 29 Apr 2025 13:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>在本期《猩球故事》你能听到来自成都超级猩猩的力量循环Power Cycle教练——Angela的回归之路，9个月前她生下可爱的女儿，转眼间她又站在成都猩际运动会的舞台上。</span></p><span></span><p><span>关于力量训练的入门与进阶、产后健身指南、女生进入健身行业所要面对的身材羞辱、作为超级猩猩的至暗时刻和闪光时刻等等，她畅所欲言：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> 产后回到猩猩舞台，力量训练举足轻重</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="660">11:00</a> 健身教练是一个可以终身学习的职业</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="972">16:12</a> 超级猩猩的女性用户让我战胜身材羞辱</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1440">24:00</a> 我一定要加入超级猩猩！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1663">27:43</a> 小白和老司机都能全力释放的课程</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1946">32:26</a> 那些睡不着的夜是至暗时刻</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2227">37:07</a> 教练的发光时刻居然是一场演讲？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2553">42:33</a> 很温暖，所以很超级猩猩</span></p><span></span><p><span>💡本期制作</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播：鲸鱼</span></p><span></span><p><span>嘉宾：Angela</span></p><span></span><p><span>摄制：汤汤、阿肆</span></p><span></span><p><span>制作：鲸鱼</span></p><span></span><p><span>音乐：BalloonPlanet - Steady Hearts Stronger Roads - No Backing Vocals ，TILLANDER - Brighter</span></p>]]></description>
