  <item>
    <title>打卡“成都特产”拉措娜尔，解锁猩猩狂野派Zumba教练</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/680f48788aed253fa301687d</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">680f48788aed253fa301687d</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 28 Apr 2025 12:58:41 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期《猩球故事》的嘉宾是成都超级猩猩的Zumba教练——拉措娜尔。</span></p><span></span><p><span>有人说Zumba是i人地狱，她第一个不服，作为i人教练，拉措深谙i人心理以及如何让大家更好享受一堂Zumba课。有人说光上有氧课没有训练痕迹，她的学员在拉措的Zumba跳出了马甲线。</span></p><span></span><p><span>刚开始接触Zumba的时候，拉措的第一印象竟然是“土”？后来2024年，赢得猩球联赛第一名为什么是她的至暗时刻？用“狂”和“野”形容自己的她也有不为人知的温柔和感性？</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期节目一起来深挖拉措的课程精髓和个人魅力。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> 成都猩际运动会的Zumba名场面</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="207">03:27</a> 管他i人还是e人，跳就完了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="413">06:53</a> Zumba教练对Zumba竟然是“土”？！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="714">11:54</a> Zumba的热情是不言而喻的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="754">12:34</a> i人教练给i人的建议</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1255">20:55</a> 教练和学员是相互充电的关系</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1697">28:17</a>“Zumba就是我的生命”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1925">32:05</a> 高低起伏的猩球之旅，没有白走的路</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2377">39:37</a> 带领团队闪闪发光</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2737">45:37</a> Zumba就是“耍”！</span></p><span></span><p><span>💡本期制作</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播：鲸鱼</span></p><span></span><p><span>嘉宾：拉措娜尔</span></p><span></span><p><span>摄制：汤汤、阿肆</span></p><span></span><p><span>制作：鲸鱼</span></p><span></span><p><span>音乐：The Ladyproducer - Afro Love - Instrumental Version，Matan Gov Ari - Un Pasito Mas - Instrumental Version，Analog Zoo - Latin Breeze</span></p>]]></description>
