    <pubDate>Wed, 19 Feb 2025 13:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>过去一年，北京单车教练Miao一直戴着帽子上课，最近她摘下来了。这顶帽子下曾掩藏着痛苦和悲伤，但经历考试失利、人生至暗时刻的她从来没想过放弃，走去超级猩猩的路上、站上操台、坐在单车上的瞬间，有一束打身上的光给予她力量，这分量又被她传递给无数学员，从早课的清晨出发，骑进人生的旷野……</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="24">00:24</a> 上辈子打拳，这辈子骑车</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="701">11:41</a> 我的单车早课节节满员！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1058">17:38</a> 至暗时刻教会我“别留遗憾”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1410">23:30</a> 站在台上的时刻就很闪闪发光</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1500">25:00</a> 创新是超级猩猩的基因</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1606">26:46</a> 跳跳竟然是这种老板？！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1702">28:22</a> 十年后我依然会在超级猩猩</span></p><span></span><p><span>💡本期制作</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播：汤汤</span></p><span></span><p><span>嘉宾：Miao</span></p><span></span><p><span>摄制：阿肆</span></p><span></span><p><span>制作：鲸鱼</span></p><span></span><p><span>音乐：Alon Peretz - If You Build It，Dodo Danciu - Scarlett</span></p>]]></description>
